        "original_id": "7ceb949c-96d4-5286-bb63-ac5d6436ce4d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Finance, I'm the Boss!, Monopoly\n- Concepts: The Landlord's Game, Chance cards, Community Chest cards, negotiation games, business deals\n\nFacts:\n- Finance is based on The Landlord's Game in its movement of pieces around the board, its use of cards, its purchasable properties, and its houses that can be erected on properties.\n- Chance cards and Community Chest cards are special cards used in the board games Monopoly and Finance.\n- I'm the Boss! is a negotiation game in which players compete and cooperate to assemble profitable business deals.",
